{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792502646, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}}
[0.011919, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.012044, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.012081, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m  9 \u00b7 Oversight\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.014027, "o", "\u001b[2m  recorded run \u00b7 Tue 20 Oct 2026, 15:24 CEST\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.014048, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.01632, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  People propose a change in a pull request, a reviewer approves it, and the pipeline applies \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.018774, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  On the control plane that is plain RBAC: the team can read its models, only the pipeline \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    can change them.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.018963, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 Who changed what \u001b[2m(metadata.managedFields)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.018995, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl -n ml-team get modeldeployment qwen-7b --show-managed-fields -o yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.048718, "o", "  \u001b[32mcontroller \u001b[0m apiextensions.crossplane.io/composite  status\r\n"]
[0.048791, "o", "  \u001b[32mcontroller \u001b[0m crossplane                             status\r\n  \u001b[36mperson     \u001b[0m kubectl-client-side-apply              spec.template\r\n"]
[0.049047, "o", "\u001b[2m  With GitOps, the person's row becomes Argo CD or Flux: the pull request is the approval.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.049086, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.049108, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.049113, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 Who may do what in ml-team\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.049125, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl -n ml-team get rolebinding ml-team-view gitops-edit -o wide\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.07741, "o", "NAME           ROLE                          AGE   USERS   GROUPS   SERVICEACCOUNTS\r\n"]
[0.077452, "o", "ml-team-view   ClusterRole/crossplane-view   78m   alice            \r\ngitops-edit    ClusterRole/crossplane-edit   78m                    argocd/argocd-application-controller\r\n"]
[0.078893, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.078914, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 A team member tries to scale up by hand\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.078952, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl --as=alice -n ml-team patch modeldeployment qwen-7b \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.078967, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    --type merge -p '{\"spec\":{\"replicas\":2}}' --dry-run=server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.11304, "o", "  \u001b[31mforbidden: User \"alice\" cannot patch resource \"modeldeployments\" \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[31min API group \"modelplane.ai\" in the namespace \"ml-team\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.113222, "o", "\u001b[2m  alice can still see it:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.113245, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl --as=alice -n ml-team get modeldeployment\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.14012, "o", "NAME      REPLICAS   SYNCED   READY   AGE\r\n"]
[0.140161, "o", "qwen-7b   2          True     True    78m\r\n"]
[0.141534, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.141578, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.141593, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 The pipeline can\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.141618, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl auth can-i patch modeldeployments.modelplane.ai -n ml-team \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.141634, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    --as=system:serviceaccount:argocd:argocd-application-controller\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.185796, "o", "  \u001b[32myes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.185847, "o", "\u001b[2m  The change is the pull request: Git holds who proposed it and who approved it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\ud83d\udca1 People propose in Git, a reviewer approves, the pipeline applies.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
